    {
      "itemId": 3903025369,
      "allowsOffers": false,
      "availability": {
        "isAvailable": true,
        "reason": null
      },
      "comments": "(USED)   Vinyl has large concentration of light scratches and heavier use marks as well as scuffing.  Plays with steady background crackle. So many tight, funky jams on this LP which play through along with some &#34;snap, crackle pop&#34;. Jacket has impression and edge wear, minor color losses, seams are still intact, rounded corners. Conservatively graded.  A nice first time demo copy.  Priced accordingly.",
